@section Addition (+)

Chart showing addition operator syntax across languages:

@multitable @columnfractions .20 .30 .30 .20
@headitem Language @item Operator @item Example @item Notes
@item AGI @item SET var (var + value) @item SET score (score + 10) @item Uses parentheses for expressions
@item BASIC @item + @item score = score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item Burgermistress @item + @item score = score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item COBOL @item ADD @item ADD 10 TO SCORE @item Verbose syntax
@item FORTRAN @item + @item score = score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item Lingo @item + @item gScore = gScore + 10 @item Standard infix
@item Lua @item + @item score = score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item Muddle @item + @item (setq *score* (+ *score* 10)) @item Prefix notation
@item Objective-C @item + @item score = score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item Pascal @item + @item Score := Score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item SCI @item + @item (= gScore (+ gScore 10)) @item Prefix notation
@item SCUMM @item + @item set score (score + 10) @item Standard infix
@item SmallTalk @item + @item score := score + 10 @item Standard infix
@item ZIL @item ADD @item <SETG SCORE> <ADD> <GSET SCORE> 10> @item Prefix notation
@end multitable

